{"id": "ZJJ-T05:3255:3260", "doc_id": "ZJJ-T05", "scenic": "张家界", "text_type": "游客游记", "source_name": "BAAI/IndustryCorpus2", "source_record_id": "1173700007150", "source_file": "rank_00712.parquet", "source_url": null, "sentence": "十里画廊有猴子,道路平缓,建议不坐小火车,三姐妹峰,采药老人,全家福,食指峰,驼骆峰,不需要导游,自己边走边看,都能看出来,可以蹭导游.", "sentence_start": 3247, "condition": "道路平缓", "condition_start": 3255, "condition_end": 3259, "advice": "建议不坐小火车", "advice_start": 3260, "advice_end": 3267, "trigger": "road", "condition_type": "其他显式条件", "traveler_type": "普通游客"}
